Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:08:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Screen link: the page's cursor in SCREEN and SCREEN_GOTO
 (INFO 56 01 2)

Two bytes after the flags: what KNOB 1 picks on a page instead of a value
(MOD's route, a lane, a sound or operator, the slice marker, a sample, a user
slot, a pattern and its ACTION, the NOTES/FEEL selection, the AUTOMATION row,
the SONG entry), 127 where a page has none. Pushed when it moves, with WATCH
bit 2. SCREEN_GOTO takes an optional cursor, clamped; refused on a page
without one. +776 B flash over the first version.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
