Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Screen link: METER (92), each track's level as the MIXER
 draws it (INFO 56 01 3)

WATCH bit 3 asks for it: pushed after a 40 ms reading in which a level changed, once a
second while none does; the lowest push, sent only into an empty queue in a pass that
pushed nothing else. The screen's meters and METER each take the peak since their own
last reading (ui.c peak_take), so the device's meters are unchanged.

